#: desc: DSUB replaces text in the docs; it can be combined with SUB
-v COLOR=0 -v SUB='t3:target3:v1 v2' -v DSUB='$(Y):S~y;$(VAR):S~var' test/fixtures/Makefile.dsub
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
t1        Description with a dsub: S~var
t2        This description refers to S~var as well
target3   SUB and DSUB $(complement) each other (S~y):
          v1
          v2

-----------------------
Command-line arguments:
-----------------------
X         S~var and
          S~y will both be replaced
-----------------------
